00:50:51.238 --> 00:50:54.671
<i>"Rasanya seperti sakau."</i>

00:50:56.272 --> 00:50:59.803
<i>"Jeremy tak lagi memujaku,</i>
<i>tak lagi mencintaiku."</i>

00:51:05.905 --> 00:51:07.703
<i>"Saat si kembar lahir,</i>

00:51:07.770 --> 00:51:10.670
<i>"Jeremy sering membahas</i>
<i>kematian bayi mendadak</i>

00:51:10.737 --> 00:51:12.871
<i>"dan banyak membaca soal itu.</i>

00:51:12.938 --> 00:51:16.138
<i>"Artinya aku banyak</i>
<i>mendengar soal itu.</i>

00:51:16.205 --> 00:51:20.138
<i>"Yang paling memikatku adalah</i>

00:51:20.205 --> 00:51:23.305
<i>"sulitnya membedakan</i>
<i>kematian bayi mendadak</i>

00:51:23.371 --> 00:51:24.436
<i>"dan mati lemas."</i>

00:51:38.770 --> 00:51:40.436
Hei.

00:51:40.503 --> 00:51:42.570
Hei.

00:51:42.637 --> 00:51:43.770
