00:55:40.635 --> 00:55:42.635
Ayo ucapkan selamat malam ke Mama.

00:55:42.701 --> 00:55:44.334
Selamat malam, Lowen.

00:55:44.400 --> 00:55:45.701
Selamat malam.

00:56:10.868 --> 00:56:14.167
Itu Harper.

00:56:16.668 --> 00:56:18.668
