00:56:57.334 --> 00:56:59.967
Apa mereka dekat,
Harper dan Crew?

00:57:00.533 --> 00:57:01.901
Ya.

00:57:02.268 --> 00:57:03.734
Mereka dekat.

00:57:09.001 --> 00:57:10.767
Ia...

00:57:10.834 --> 00:57:12.967
