00:57:59.033 --> 00:58:00.766
Aku baik-baik saja.

00:58:25.466 --> 00:58:26.733
Papa?

00:58:28.367 --> 00:58:30.133
Ya, Nak.

00:58:30.200 --> 00:58:32.066
Aku tak bisa tidur.

00:58:35.133 --> 00:58:37.566
Baik, Papa datang.

01:02:01.797 --> 01:02:03.997
Saatnya makan saus apel.

01:02:07.497 --> 01:02:09.163
