01:02:14.597 --> 01:02:15.963
<i>Hai, Lowen.</i>

01:02:16.030 --> 01:02:17.397
<i>Sudah sampai mana</i>
<i>proses Anda?</i>

01:02:17.464 --> 01:02:18.830
<i>Tim Pemasaran dan Humas kami</i>

01:02:18.897 --> 01:02:20.265
