Ha, Papa ambil kepingnya.

01:05:33.229 --> 01:05:34.263
Tidak, bukan begitu.

01:05:34.329 --> 01:05:35.594
Hai.

01:05:37.363 --> 01:05:39.129
Hai.

01:05:39.394 --> 01:05:41.328
Hai.

