Kenapa nama E.T. pendek?

01:05:47.928 --> 01:05:48.794
Apa?

01:05:48.861 --> 01:05:50.362
Karena kakinya pendek.

01:05:50.427 --> 01:05:51.861
Kakinya pendek.

01:05:51.928 --> 01:05:54.129
Lelucon yang bagus.

01:05:54.195 --> 01:05:55.694
