Semua penulis punya proses, kan?
Bagaimana prosesmu?

01:06:27.394 --> 01:06:29.161
Astaga.

01:06:34.561 --> 01:06:35.827
Yah, aku...

01:06:36.860 --> 01:06:38.594
mulai menulis...

01:06:38.660 --> 01:06:41.262
