01:50:10.867 --> 01:50:13.366
<i>berlandaskan sembilan pedoman</i>
<i>moral dan etika.</i>

01:50:13.433 --> 01:50:15.066
<i>Ya.</i>

01:50:15.132 --> 01:50:17.000
